[
  {
    "text": "Some mornings arrive quietly,",
    "startMs": 0,
    "endMs": 1680,
    "timestampMs": 0,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "before the world remembers your name.",
    "startMs": 1680,
    "endMs": 3800,
    "timestampMs": 1680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The light is thin and unhurried,",
    "startMs": 3800,
    "endMs": 5560,
    "timestampMs": 3800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "laying gold across the floor like it has nowhere else to be.",
    "startMs": 5560,
    "endMs": 8720,
    "timestampMs": 5560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "No alarm has sharpened yet into a demand.",
    "startMs": 8720,
    "endMs": 11440,
    "timestampMs": 8720,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "No screen has told you who to become today.",
    "startMs": 11440,
    "endMs": 13400,
    "timestampMs": 11440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You sit, you breathe.",
    "startMs": 13400,
    "endMs": 14600,
    "timestampMs": 13400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Nothing is asked of you yet.",
    "startMs": 14600,
    "endMs": 16080,
    "timestampMs": 14600,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And in that small, unclaimed hour,",
    "startMs": 16080,
    "endMs": 17880,
    "timestampMs": 16080,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "you are not a list of things to do.",
    "startMs": 17880,
    "endMs": 19800,
    "timestampMs": 17880,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You are not the sum of what you finished",
    "startMs": 19800,
    "endMs": 21520,
    "timestampMs": 19800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "or the weight of what you didn't.",
    "startMs": 21520,
    "endMs": 22800,
    "timestampMs": 21520,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "You are simply here.",
    "startMs": 22800,
    "endMs": 24200,
    "timestampMs": 22800,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Soft and unfinished and allowed.",
    "startMs": 24200,
    "endMs": 26840,
    "timestampMs": 24200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Notice how the room holds you without wanting anything back.",
    "startMs": 26840,
    "endMs": 29680,
    "timestampMs": 26840,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Notice how the quiet does not rush to be filled.",
    "startMs": 29680,
    "endMs": 32240,
    "timestampMs": 29680,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The day will come for you soon enough with its noise,",
    "startMs": 32240,
    "endMs": 34440,
    "timestampMs": 32240,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "its hands, its hunger.",
    "startMs": 34440,
    "endMs": 36000,
    "timestampMs": 34440,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "It will ask and ask and ask again.",
    "startMs": 36000,
    "endMs": 38120,
    "timestampMs": 36000,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But this, this hush before the asking.",
    "startMs": 38120,
    "endMs": 40320,
    "timestampMs": 38120,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "This is yours, hold it lightly.",
    "startMs": 40320,
    "endMs": 42280,
    "timestampMs": 40320,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Let it fill you slowly the way morning fills a window.",
    "startMs": 42280,
    "endMs": 45120,
    "timestampMs": 42280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Then rise unhurried and carry a little of the quiet",
    "startMs": 45120,
    "endMs": 47960,
    "timestampMs": 45120,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "into everything you touch.",
    "startMs": 47960,
    "endMs": 49560,
    "timestampMs": 47960,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Into the first word you speak.",
    "startMs": 49560,
    "endMs": 51280,
    "timestampMs": 49560,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Into the way you meet the noise.",
    "startMs": 51280,
    "endMs": 53480,
    "timestampMs": 51280,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Into the person you choose to be",
    "startMs": 53480,
    "endMs": 55280,
    "timestampMs": 53480,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "before the world decides for you.",
    "startMs": 55280,
    "endMs": 57200,
    "timestampMs": 55280,
    "confidence": null
  }
]